<title>JAPAN: JAPAN JULY ETHYLENE OUTPUT DOWN 9.6 PCT YR/YR-MITI.</title>
<headline>JAPAN JULY ETHYLENE OUTPUT DOWN 9.6 PCT YR/YR-MITI.</headline>
<dateline>TOKYO 1997-08-11</dateline>
<text>
<p>Japan's ethylene output fell by 9.6 percent in July from a year earlier to 580,700 tonnes as two ethylene centres were shut for maintenance checks, compared with one plant closed for checks in July 1996, the trade ministry said on Monday.</p>
<p>The July production was down 3.7 percent from the previous month, in which only one ethylene plant was closed for scheduled maintenance, an official for the Ministry of International Trade and Industry (MITI) said.</p>
<p>--Tokyo Energy Desk +81-3-3432-8837</p>
